&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed revenue targets through strategic sales and account management efforts, aligning with broader commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships in managed accounts, aiming to elevate them to the Regional/Enterprise level or identify opportunities for MSAs across the global portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new revenue growth by capitalizing on opportunities in the experiential events market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a go-to expert on Convene product offerings, including meetings and technology solutions, and translate product features into functional client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an engaging sales presence, both in person and virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate thorough knowledge of competitors, articulating the Convene story and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow demand through strategic account development, expanding your network of contacts, and building long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of Convene products and locations, contributing to local and regional brand building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the local, regional, and global business plan to ensure personal targets align with overall sales objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market intelligence and industry trends with the Senior Leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and coordinate site inspections, virtual tours, client meetings, and quarterly business reviews for key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover and build relationships with new decision-makers, while nurturing current and prospective clients and referral partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond rapidly to client inquiries and maintain up-to-date account details for key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close agreements, adhering to internal pricing guidelines while ensuring client specifications are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed of competitive landscape and maintain relationships with industry counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend trade shows, networking sessions, and events to prospect for new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceed budgeted financial goals for both quarterly and annual targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with allocated key accounts through consultative sales efforts to achieve and surpass commercial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage a portfolio of accounts based on location, volume, and spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target and secure new business to increase market share across the global portfolio of brands and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure repeat business from allocated accounts, ensuring long-term client satisfaction and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
