&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Manager who leads strategy and architecture projects focused on GenAI solutions. You will own the design of architectures and solutions end to end, balancing business value, technology choices and economics across every dimension of the decision.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will lead development teams, present solutions to C-level stakeholders and run technical and strategic workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Project and programme leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead strategy and architecture projects on GenAI, from scoping and business case through to solution design and rollout oversight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own project plans, budgets, risks and quality, ensuring delivery against client objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Shape proposals, estimates and demos, and identify follow-on opportunities with clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architecture and solution design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design GenAI architectures and solutions: RAG, agentic systems, multi-agent orchestration, MCP and A2A integration, copilots and assistants.&lt;/div&gt;
